&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of the Connect Sales team led by Louise, Director of Sales Connect. The team consists of 8 Account Executive covering EMEA Scope. As the SMB Account Executive for the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;DACH region&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll be driving new business growth by expanding Mirakl Connect&#39;s reach across the SMB segment and bringing more sellers and brands onto the platform in Germany, Austria, and Switzerland.&lt;/div&gt;
