&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Proactively identify, prospect, and engage new SMB sellers and brands — owning the full sales cycle from discovery and solution presentation through to negotiation and close.&lt;/li&gt;
